tive function (line 31) by calling member function calculateObj and checks
whether the change of the objective function is less than the threshold. If the
change of the objective function is less than the threshold, then the function
terminates itself. The function also checks whether the maximum number of
iterations is reached or not. If the maximum number of iterations is reached,
then the function terminates itself.
